'=================================================================================
' TRANSFORMATION RULES SUMMARY - FINAL VERSION WITH MAPPING
'=================================================================================
'
' OUTPUT COLUMN HEADERS:
' Column 1: Top C (mapped from Level 2 Name using GetTopCValue function)
' Column 2: Middle C
' Column 3: Middle C
' Column 4: Middle C
' Column 5: Lowest C
' Column 6: N element
'
' TOP C MAPPING (Configurable in GetTopCValue function):
' - Central Managed offices → RBMI - MISC
' - Central Managed Services → RBMI - MISC
' - Comm Businesses & Mkts → RBMI - Group Communications & Brand (L3)
' - Group Brand L2 → RBMI - Group Brand L2
' - Group External Communication → RBMI - Group External Communication
' - Enterprise Talent BC → RBMI - Enterprise Talent BC
' - Governance → RBMI - Governance
' - Grp Chief Cntrl Oversight Off → RBMI - Grp Chief Cntrl Oversight Off
' - Internal Audit → RBMI - Internal Audit (L2)
' - Legal → RBMI - Legal (L2)
' - Risk & Compliance → RBMI - Risk & Compliance (L2)
' - Finance Function → RBMI - Finance Function
' - Global Sustainability → RBMI - Global Sustainability
' - People → RBMI - HR
' - [Any other] → RBMI - [Level 2 Name] (L2)
'
' TO ADD NEW MAPPINGS:
' 1. Open VBA Editor (Alt+F11)
' 2. Find the GetTopCValue function
' 3. Add a new Case statement in the Select Case block
' 4. Format: Case "LEVEL 2 NAME": GetTopCValue = "Desired Output"
' 5. Save and run
'
' FILTERING RULES (ALL MUST BE TRUE TO PROCESS):
' 1. Comments column must contain "new" (case-insensitive, wildcard)
' 2. Level1 Name must be "Alpha" OR "Kenamma" OR "Naago"
' 3. Level5 Name must NOT contain "Retained", "Retd", or "Rtd"
'
' FOR EACH INPUT ROW THAT PASSES FILTERS, GENERATE 3 OUTPUT ROWS:
'
' Row 1:
'   Column 1 (Top C): [Mapped value from GetTopCValue function]
'   Column 2 (Middle C): "RBMI - GIA_ALL" if STD/STEWARDSHIP, else "RBMI - GIA_ATT"
'   Column 3 (Middle C): "GIA_NCRALL" if STD/STEWARDSHIP, else "GIA_NCRATT"
'   Column 4 (Middle C): "."
'   Column 5 (Lowest C): "RBMI - [Level5 ID]_NCR"
'   Column 6 (N element): "R-[Level5 ID]"
'
' Row 2:
'   Column 1 (Top C): [Mapped value from GetTopCValue function]
'   Column 2 (Middle C): "RBMI - GIA_ALL" if STD/STEWARDSHIP, else "RBMI - GIA_ATT"
'   Column 3 (Middle C): "GIA_RACALL" if STD/STEWARDSHIP, else "GIA_RACATT"
'   Column 4 (Middle C): "GIA_ARACALL" if STD/STEWARDSHIP, else "GIA_ARACATT"
'   Column 5 (Lowest C): "RBMI - [Level5 ID]_ARAC"
'   Column 6 (N element): "I-Dummy"
'
' Row 3:
'   Column 1 (Top C): [Mapped value from GetTopCValue function]
'   Column 2 (Middle C): "RBMI - GIA_ALL" if STD/STEWARDSHIP, else "RBMI - GIA_ATT"
'   Column 3 (Middle C): "GIA_RACALL" if STD/STEWARDSHIP, else "GIA_RACATT"
'   Column 4 (Middle C): "GIA_SRACALL" if STD/STEWARDSHIP, else "GIA_SRACATT"
'   Column 5 (Lowest C): "RBMI - [Level5 ID]_SRAC"
'   Column 6 (N element): "I-Dummy"
'
'=================================================================================